==Release information==
This card was one of seven cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 9 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Ultra Beast Drop Event]], which ran from June 4 to 14, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{form|Necrozma|Dawn Wings Necrozma}}, a form of {{p|Necrozma}} obtained by fusing it with {{p|Lunala}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Dawn Wings Necrozma|106}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos|Sun & Moon Black Star Promos}}.
*The '''Psychobilly''' attack is named after {{wp|psychobilly}}, a genre of music. The name may have been chosen in reference to the card's {{TCG|Psychic}} type.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

